Ported from filament/src/ToneMapper.cpp (AgxToneMapper) and filament/src/ColorSpaceUtils.h (the
Rec. 709 and Rec. 2020 matrices), main branch, fetched 2026-09-29, into:

  apps/hyperion/src/renderer/src/view/photometry/toneCurve.ts
  apps/hyperion/src/renderer/src/view/shaders/toneCurve.wgsl

Changes: ported to TypeScript and WGSL, without the AgX looks, and wrapped in the linear Rec. 709 to
Rec. 2020 conversions and the final clamp that Filament's colour grading applies around the tone
mapper. Filament's AgX matrices are in turn taken from Blender's AgX
(https://github.com/EaryChow/AgX_LUT_Gen, AgXBaseRec2020.py), and its sigmoid is adapted from
iolite-engine's minimal AgX (https://iolite-engine.com/blog_posts/minimal_agx_implementation).

